          "question": "e-6566",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Which of the following second-order differential equations are linear?\n\n- $y'' + (y-1)y'+x = 2$\n\n- $y''+y'=x \\cos x$\n\n- $yy'' - y'+ 9 = 0$",
          "category": "ma_capture",
